    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Begley are delighted to present this three-bedroom semi-detached residence, ideally located in a convenient residential setting in Ballinasloe. Offering bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this home is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families or investors seeking a property with excellent potential.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a spacious living room, providing the perfect space to relax and entertain. A separate kitchen offers ample storage and workspace, with direct access to the rear of the property. A convenient guest WC off the back hallway completes the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the property boasts three generously sized bedrooms and a well-appointed family bathroom. The practical layout makes this an ideal family home, offering comfortable living with scope for personalisation.\n\nA standout feature of the property is the attached garage, providing excellent additional storage or potential for conversion (subject to the necessary planning permission). Externally, the property enjoys both front and rear gardens with off-street parking.\n\nIdeally positioned, this home benefits from easy access to Ballinasloe town centre, where a wide range of amenities including schools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, sporting facilities and public transport links are all within easy reach. The nearby M6 motorway also provides excellent connectivity to Galway, Athlone and Dublin, making this an ideal location for commuters.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in a sought-after location, combining practicality, convenience and excellent potential."
      },
